{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>BLOOD VIAL\u00a0</strong></i>is a vampiric, retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Holy Ones have gained control. Reach the sacred source of power draining you of your energy, and destroy it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive through spilled blood to climb walls, swim through grates, and leap over gaps. Learn to harness your blood powers to their maximum potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get messy with the shotgun, or execute with precision using the revolver. Unlock more weapons and experiment with your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seal sacred pacts to gain power - but choose wisely, for these powers have their drawbacks...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Blood Vial</i>\u00a0<i>was inspired by Post Void, Splatoon and Ultrakill.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648730?t=1744803599","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648730?t=1744803599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648730/d42163822f4b6c51622baa04f04c9f64798ebb59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744803599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648730/d42163822f4b6c51622baa04f04c9f64798ebb59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744803599","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>BLOOD VIAL\u00a0</strong></i>is a vampiric, retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Holy Ones have gained control. Reach the sacred source of power draining you of your energy, and destroy it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive through spilled blood to climb walls, swim through grates, and leap over gaps. Learn to harness your blood powers to their maximum potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get messy with the shotgun, or execute with precision using the revolver. Unlock more weapons and experiment with your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seal sacred pacts to gain power - but choose wisely, for these powers have their drawbacks...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Blood Vial</i>\u00a0<i>was inspired by Post Void, Splatoon and Ultrakill.</i></p>","developers":["Dillon Steyl"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648730/ef9fe472a6a2ba74214928f3660756e50ffafb18/header.jpg?t=1744803599","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123090,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123090/movie480.mp4?t=1744191577","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123090/movie_max.mp4?t=1744191577"},"name":"Gameplay Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123090/48360fb4722424e4f96e178cfe3e9b033e3053e2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744191577","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123090/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744191577","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123090/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744191577"}}],"name":"Blood Vial","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> W